{"4750050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Critical Fall", "steam_appid": 4750050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an enchanted die,  climb through a dungeon full of tricky platforms and trap doors in an attempt to escape from dice jail! This punishing climbing game requires well-timed jumps and balance to reach the top of the treacherous tower, where your freedom awaits. The higher the number you roll, the higher your jump...but one fall could be critical, and you'll be back to square one! <br><br>If you are up for the challenge, try out multiple different dice shapes from the tabletop dice selection and set your quickest time to ascend to the top of the tower!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an enchanted die,  climb through a dungeon full of tricky platforms and trap doors in an attempt to escape from dice jail! This punishing climbing game requires well-timed jumps and balance to reach the top of the treacherous tower, where your freedom awaits. The higher the number you roll, the higher your jump...but one fall could be critical, and you'll be back to square one! <br><br>If you are up for the challenge, try out multiple different dice shapes from the tabletop dice selection and set your quickest time to ascend to the top of the tower!</p>", "short_description": "Roll for pain! This precision-based platformer, where one fall could be critical!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750050/d48e139f132088769abec8f6535cb734e68e5032/header.jpg?t=1779895627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750050/7e41beee879535f33a7bb6f389d22ffbc96fd31e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779895627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam